WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.460
When a cleaning rule is strong enough to update data
use a controlled workflow Preview

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:12.406
with SELECT Start a transaction Run

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:18.425
UPDATE with a narrow condition Use RETURNING to
inspect the changed rows

00:00:20.266 --> 00:00:26.038
Then either commit the change or roll it back This
makes destructive cleaning

00:00:26.064 --> 00:00:26.840
much safer
